        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>50个行为经济学概念</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .concept-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .concept-label {\n    min-width: 220px;\n    max-width: 220px;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .concept-desc {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .concept-desc::before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Color classes for labels */\n  .label-orange { background: #f58220; }\n  .label-gray { background: #9e9e9e; }\n  .label-yellow { background: #f5b800; }\n  .label-blue { background: #4a90d9; }\n  .label-green { background: #4caf50; }\n\n  /* Color classes for descriptions */\n  .desc-orange { background: #fde8d8; }\n  .desc-gray { background: #e8e8e8; }\n  .desc-yellow { background: #fef3d0; }\n  .desc-blue { background: #d6e8f7; }\n  .desc-green { background: #d4edda; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"title-bar\">50个行为经济学概念</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-orange\">内在动机（Intrinsic Motivation）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-orange\">基于内在兴趣和满足感进行行动的动机，而非外部奖励或惩罚。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-gray\">比较效用（Relative Utility）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-gray\">人们对于收益和满足感的评估通常是基于相对参照点的比较，而非绝对数值。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-yellow\">消费者无知（Consumer Ignorance）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-yellow\">消费者对于市场信息和产品特性的缺乏了解，导致决策受到影响。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-blue\">合作与竞争（Cooperation vs. Competition）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-blue\">人们在决策和行为中受到与他人合作或竞争的影响，从而改变决策策略。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-green\">持续效应（Sunk Cost Fallacy）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-green\">人们倾向于将过去已经发生的成本视为不可逆转，继续投入资源，即使当前决策并不理性。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-orange\">心理账户（Mental Account）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-orange\">人们对于不同资金来源的分配和使用会有不同的偏好和行为，形成不同的心理账户。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-gray\">失败回避（Loss Avoidance）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-gray\">人们更倾向于避免损失而非追求收益，因此在决策中可能会选择保守的选择。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-yellow\">群体迷思（Groupthink）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-yellow\">在群体中，人们为了与他人保持一致和获得认同而放弃独立思考，导致决策偏差。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-blue\">时间不一致（Time Inconsistency）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-blue\">人们在时间跨度较长的决策中容易受到即时满足的影响，而忽视长期利益。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"concept-row\">\n  <div class=\"concept-label label-green\">心理障碍（Psychological Barrier）</div>\n  <div class=\"concept-desc desc-green\">人们在决策中受到情绪、态度和信念等心理因素的影响，产生决策偏差。</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to convert an image of a Chinese infographic about \"50 Behavioral Economics Concepts\" into HTML. Let me analyze the layout:\n\n1. Title: \"50个行为经济学概念\" in large white text on black background\n2. A list of 10 concepts, each with:\n   - A colored label box on the left (with Chinese name and English name)\n   - A description on the right with a bullet point\n\nThe colors alternate:\n- Orange: 内在动机 (Intrinsic Motivation)\n- Gray: 比较效用 (Relative Utility)\n- Yellow/Gold: 消费者无知 (Consumer Ignorance)\n- Blue: 合作与竞争 (Cooperation vs. Competition)\n- Green: 持续效应 (Sunk Cost Fallacy)\n- Orange: 心理账户 (Mental Account)\n- Gray: 失败回避 (Loss Avoidance)\n- Yellow/Gold: 群体迷思 (Groupthink)\n- Blue: 时间不一致 (Time Inconsistency)\n- Green: 心理障碍 (Psychological Barrier)\n\nEach row has a colored label on the left and a light-colored description box on the right. The description boxes have light background colors matching the label colors but lighter.\n\nLet me create the HTML with proper layout using flexbox."
